      "content_body": "1. Verify that the data residency flags match the customer's configured region. 2. Check for any recent configuration changes that might have introduced unsupported settings. 3. If logs are missing, run the standard data repair script to backfill entries. 4. For persistent gaps, perform a manual reconciliation against the transaction database. Ensure the customer is educated on proper logging retention policies to prevent future issues."
