      "content_summary": "Diagnosing service outages and health check failures caused by race conditions or dependency failures. Details on when to escalate to engineering or engage vendors.",
      "content_body": "Service unresponsiveness and 503 errors often stem from a race condition in the Load Balancer's health check logic or a downstream dependency failure in the Queue Manager. First, check if the issue persists across all nodes; if so, it indicates a broader dependency failure. Engaging the vendor may be required for external dependencies. For internal race conditions, apply the latest product patch. If the patch is unavailable, escalate to engineering immediately to mitigate the outage."
