      "content_summary": "Troubleshooting missing welcome emails during user onboarding. Addresses bulk import failures and stuck provisioning states due to dependency or operator errors.",
      "content_body": "Welcome emails may not be delivered if the Identity Vault's provisioning queue is stuck due to a downstream dependency failure. Check the status of the email service integration first. If the integration is healthy, review the bulk import logs for operator errors, such as malformed CSV data. Resolving these issues typically requires a configuration change to the import schema or engaging the email vendor. Educate customers on verifying email addresses before bulk uploads to prevent recurring issues."
