      "title": "HTTP 403 Errors and Role Assignment Issues in Session Controller",
      "content_summary": "Troubleshooting unexpected permission denials and roles not applying correctly. Focuses on policy misconfigurations and improper access reviews.",
      "content_body": "Users receiving HTTP 403 errors often have incorrect role assignments due to policy misconfigurations in the Session Controller. First, verify that the intended role is actually attached to the user's profile. If the role is correct but permissions are still denied, check the Funnel Analyzer for conflicting policies. An improper access review is a frequent root cause; ensure that all recent changes have been validated. Apply the necessary policy corrections and complete a fresh access review to resolve the issue."
    },
