      "title": "Chat Widget 502 Errors and DNS Resolution Issues",
      "content_summary": "Troubleshooting service unresponsiveness and HTTP 502 errors in the Chat Widget. Covers incorrect DNS configuration and expired certificates.",
      "content_body": "HTTP 502 errors in the Chat Widget often result from incorrect DNS configuration preventing proper resolution of backend services. Verify the DNS records and ensure they point to the correct active endpoints. Expired SSL certificates can also cause connection warnings and subsequent failures; renew these immediately. If DNS and certificates are correct, check for packet loss between the widget client and the server. Resolving these network-level issues typically involves DNS correction and certificate renewal."
