      "title": "Invoice Discrepancies and Subscription Renewal Failures",
      "content_summary": "Resolving overcharges, undercharges, and stuck payments in Billing. Addresses proration errors, tax calculation issues, and currency conversions.",
      "content_body": "Subscription charged twice is often due to a payment stuck in processing state; manually reconcile the transaction in the billing portal. For incorrect tax amounts or proration, verify the customer's tax residency and billing cycle dates. Currency conversion errors may require a configuration change in the billing engine. If the issue is an overcharge, issue a credit note and adjust the subscription plan accordingly. Always check for recent changes in tax laws or billing configurations that might have triggered these discrepancies."
